5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Hello everyone. Since our current arrangement is failing, we need a sustainable system. Let's start by gathering the facts to ensure a fair split of costs and usage.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I agree, Minako. While numbers are essential, I'm also interested in the social dynamics. We should understand why these arrangements typically sour to avoid repeating the same mistakes.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Logic should dictate our decision. I want to know the actual state of the car during daily use and how the schedule is currently impacting our reliability.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll be the one to look at the cold hard figures. We've been guessing on fuel and bills for too long; it's time for an honest picture of the expenses.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want it to be less stressful. I'm worried about how much time we spend arguing over who owes what after every single trip.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, that's a fair point. I'll look into the fixed costs to see what an even split actually looks like. I'll check the tax, insurance, and parking papers.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I'll investigate what other households have experienced and look into the period where we checked each other's figures. I suspect the process of auditing is as problematic as the cost.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I'll check the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly. I want to see if the ""system"" is failing the most basic needs.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'm going for the fuel receipts and the hours of use recorded in the diary. I want to see exactly who is driving and who is paying.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look at the month's trial of recording every run and the weeks of heavy use. I want to see how much effort the administration actually takes.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,I'll also check the fuel receipts to compare them with the fixed costs. It's important to see the total financial burden.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I think I have enough. I'll stick with the other households' experiences and our own figure-checking spell.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
17,1,3,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I'll add the mechanic's remarks to my list. The physical condition of the car is just as important as the schedule.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
19,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
20,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I'll also check the spell of checking each other's figures. If we're going to be precise, I want to know if that's where the tension lies.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,3,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll also check the hours of use in the diary. I want to see if the workload is actually balanced.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
