35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The fixed costs are quite high—over 280,000 yen. Also, the fuel receipts show a very lopsided distribution; some of us are paying far more than others.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems my suspicions were correct. Auditing each other's figures created a climate of accusation, and other groups found that asking for favors constantly is what ruins the mood.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The car is often returned with the fuel light on and rubbish inside. Worse, the weekly repeating trips are the ones most likely to collapse.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,The fuel data confirms Minako's point; it's completely unbalanced. The diary also shows that weekends are used three times as much as Tuesdays.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Recording every run took nearly an hour a week. And during heavy use weeks, we spend entire evenings just trying to coordinate. It's exhausting.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, since the usage is so skewed toward weekends, a simple even split of costs is clearly unfair to those who drive less.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Daisuke, an hour a week for recording might seem small, but combined with the ""accusatory"" feeling of checking figures, it's a recipe for resentment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, the financial unfairness is one thing, but the lack of basic courtesy regarding the car's state makes it unreliable for those of us with strict schedules.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. We have a situation where some people subsidize others while the car is treated poorly. We need a system that removes the guesswork.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I just don't want to spend more time on spreadsheets. If the ""fair"" system takes an hour a week and causes fights, is it actually better?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"We need a balance. We can't ignore the 280,000 yen in fixed costs, but we also can't have people feeling cheated by the fuel costs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"We must avoid a system that requires constant ""favors"" or meticulous auditing. That's where the social friction comes from.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I agree. Whatever we choose must ensure the car is available and ready for those weekly commitments without a struggle.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"A fixed system would solve the financial ambiguity. If we know who pays what and when, we stop the guesswork.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I agree with @Benjamin. Let's pick the option that requires the least amount of ""untangling"" and arguing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,"It seems we all want fairness, but we differ on whether that means financial precision or emotional peace.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. The goal is a system that is invisible enough that we stop talking about the car in clipped tones.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,Reliability is my priority. I want to know the car is there and clean when it's my turn.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,And I want the numbers to be honest. No more subsidizing others' trips without a clear agreement.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just want my evenings back. No more coordinating for hours.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
